"IMAGE","links":null}],"properties":{"comparer_mode":"Slide"},"widgets_values":[[{"name":"A","selected":true,"url":"/api/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_rpqeg_00001_.png&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.9300377772827999"},{"name":"B","selected":true,"url":"/api/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_rpqeg_00002_.png&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.10420597497108897"}]]},{"id":6,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[-465.50558201649415,57.48700638553552],"size":[450.94622727272736,367.65863257575745],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":164},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[12,49]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["An immense, otherworldly cenote hidden deep within a colossal cave, where towering vertical cliffs rise hundreds of meters into darkness. The cavern opens through massive natural arches, allowing soft celestial light to stream down from above, filling the interior with warm golden rays and ethereal mist. Dozens of impossibly tall waterfalls cascade from hidden openings high inside the cave walls, their silky streams descending in uninterrupted ribbons of crystal-clear water into tranquil reflective pools below. The waterfalls glow softly as they catch the warm sunlight, creating shimmering curtains of liquid gold.\n\nThe cave is alive with lush vegetation clinging to the steep rock faces. Ancient bonsai-like trees with vibrant pink and magenta blossoms grow from narrow rocky ledges, their delicate foliage contrasting beautifully against the dark charcoal stone. Their twisted trunks and windswept branches create an elegant balance between rugged geology and graceful plant life. Smaller flowering shrubs and mosses cover scattered terraces, softening the dramatic cliffs with touches of color.\n\nThe atmosphere is dreamlike and mystical. Fine mist rises from the waterfalls, diffusing the sunlight into glowing volumetric beams that illuminate the cavern with a soft amber radiance. Layers of atmospheric haze create immense depth, making the distant cliffs fade into bluish-gray shadows while the foreground remains warmly lit. The water reflects the golden light like polished glass, with subtle ripples gently distorting the reflections of the waterfalls and flowering trees.\n\nThe rock formations are monumental, featuring weathered limestone pillars, floating-looking cliff faces, narrow chasms, and giant cave openings that reveal brilliant light beyond. Every surface shows intricate erosion patterns, damp textures, hanging vines, and mineral deposits shaped over thousands of years.\n\nThe overall color palette is cinematic and harmonious: warm gold, soft ivory, pale amber, charcoal black, deep slate gray, muted teal shadows, and vibrant pink blossoms. The contrast between warm sunlight and cool cave darkness creates an enchanting fantasy atmosphere that feels ancient, sacred, and untouched by civilization.\n\nAt the bottom of the cenote, a lone human figure stands beside the mirror-like water, emphasizing the overwhelming scale of the cavern. The composition is highly vertical, drawing the eye upward through towering waterfalls and massive cave arches toward the heavenly light filtering from above.\n\nUltra-detailed fantasy environment, epic scale, photorealistic textures, cinematic composition, volumetric lighting, soft atmospheric fog, god rays, high dynamic range, breathtaking environmental storytelling, Unreal Engine 5 quality, hyper-realistic water simulation, 8K, masterpiece, magical realism, serene, majestic, timeless, awe-inspiring."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":10,"type":"EmptyLatentImage","pos":[-813.033421216313,456.06689016349713],"size":[264.67599999999993,110.05312500000002],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type"